  Id: instrument.gps
  DisplayName: Chartplotter
  Flavor: 'A chart of your own water, lit from behind, with your boat on it. It shades
    the shoal ground the way the paper chart does, remembers where you have been, and
    holds the marks you put on it - the wreck, the fuel float, the spot that fished.
    Wants a wheelhouse: the skiffs have nowhere to mount it.'
